          "isCorrect": false
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "$y = 2 - e^{-3x}$",
          "isCorrect": false
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Solution homogène : $Ce^{-3x}$. Solution particulière constante : $y_p = 2$. Générale : $y = 2 + Ce^{-3x}$. $y(0)=0 \\Rightarrow C=-2$."
