      "prompt": "Le reste de la division de $2^{50}$ par $7$ est :",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "$4$",
          "isCorrect": true
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "$1$",
          "isCorrect": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "$2$",
          "isCorrect": false
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "$6$",
          "isCorrect": false
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Petit Fermat : $2^6 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{7}$. $50 = 6 \\times 8 + 2$. Donc $2^{50} = (2^6)^8 \\cdot 2^2 \\equiv 1^8 \\cdot 4 = 4 \\pmod{7}$."
    },
